usage: teacher_provider.py [-h]
                           (--requests REQUESTS | --request-index REQUEST_INDEX)
                           [--source-root SOURCE_ROOT]
                           [--source-index SOURCE_INDEX]
                           [--max-metadata-cache-mib MAX_METADATA_CACHE_MIB]
                           --teacher-config TEACHER_CONFIG
                           --qualification-result QUALIFICATION_RESULT
                           --output OUTPUT
                           [--max-cached-bytes MAX_CACHED_BYTES]
                           [--max-scene-mib MAX_SCENE_MIB]
                           [--max-batch-images MAX_BATCH_IMAGES]
                           [--training-config TRAINING_CONFIG]
                           [--pca-fit-cache-root PCA_FIT_CACHE_ROOT]
                           [--pca-fit-cache-index PCA_FIT_CACHE_INDEX]
                           [--configured-output CONFIGURED_OUTPUT]

Explicit RAM-only teacher dependency for the existing ST trainer. Preparing
metadata never loads weights. Runtime creation is synchronous on the owning
rank after its backend is configured; the existing collective data error guard
remains responsible for all-rank failure. No cache completion is forged.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --requests REQUESTS   Original eager request JSON (legacy wiring)
  --request-index REQUEST_INDEX
                        Existing verified request metadata-index root; no
                        index build
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --source-index SOURCE_INDEX
                        Existing index of the exact qualified COMPLETE current
                        cache
  --max-metadata-cache-mib MAX_METADATA_CACHE_MIB
                        Per SQLite index allowance; combined provider
                        allowance <=256 MiB
  --teacher-config TEACHER_CONFIG
  --qualification-result QUALIFICATION_RESULT
  --output OUTPUT
  --max-cached-bytes MAX_CACHED_BYTES
                        Legacy must stay below one record; fixed8 may use only
                        its truly qualified LRU budget
  --max-scene-mib MAX_SCENE_MIB
  --max-batch-images MAX_BATCH_IMAGES
  --training-config TRAINING_CONFIG
                        Existing selected <=4 update SMOKE config; preserves
                        cell and basis
  --pca-fit-cache-root PCA_FIT_CACHE_ROOT
                        Exact existing PCA fitted cache; metadata-only
                        provenance
  --pca-fit-cache-index PCA_FIT_CACHE_INDEX
                        Required existing fit-cache index for the indexed PCA
                        scope
  --configured-output CONFIGURED_OUTPUT
                        New isolated namespace for selectable
                        training_config.json
